{\plain {\b 3} { The spectral density is
 defined as the time-averaged expectation
 of the modulus-squared of the Fourier transform
 of the pulse sequence. Again, the expectation
 is approximated by a sample average of 
the time average over repeated trials- the
 # set by choice of I.}}
}
.EQN 12 6 16195 0
